                %a{:href => "https://astronuclphysics.info/Gravitace3-5.htm"}> astronuclphysics.info/Gravitace3-5.htm
                \&amp;rbrack;
          %p
            That the
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/near+horizon+geometry"} near horizon geometry
            of the
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/extremal+black+hole"} extremal
            Reissner-Nordström black hole in 4d ins 2d
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/anti+de+Sitter+spacetime"} anti de Sitter spacetime
            times the
            = succeed "," do
